{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-index-jsx","path":"/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"onseok.blog"}},"markdownRemark":{"html":"<blockquote>\n<p>런닝과 독서를 좋아하는 안드로이드 개발자입니다. 오픈소스 문화와 기술 공유에 관심이 많아 사내외 기술 발표, 오픈소스 메인테이너 활동, 컨트리뷰션 경험을 통해 개발자 커뮤니티에 기여하고 있습니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"Work-Experiences\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Work-Experiences\" aria-label=\"Work Experiences permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>Work Experiences</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NAVER</strong> (2025.06 ~ ) </li>\n<li><strong>Yanolja F&#x26;B Solution</strong> (2024.02 ~ 2025.06)</li>\n<li><strong>Preat</strong> (2023.05 ~ 2024.01)</li>\n<li><strong>Freelancer</strong> (2022.09 ~ 2023.03)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"Open-Source-Projects\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Open-Source-Projects\" aria-label=\"Open Source Projects permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.